{{also|Tausend}}
==German==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|goh|de}} {{term|dūsunt|lang=goh}}, akin to Old Saxon {{term|thūsund|lang=osx}}. Ultimately from {{etyl|gem-pro|de}} {{m|gem-pro|*þūsundī}}. Compare Dutch {{term|duizend|lang=de}}, West Frisian {{term|tûzen|lang=fy}}, English ''[[thousand]]'', Danish {{term|tusind|lang=da}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈtaʊ̯zn̩t/|/ˈtaʊ̯zənt/|lang=de}}
* {{audio|De-tausend.ogg|audio|lang=de}}

